# Every package of the module, placed for the audit (docs/06-verification.md §5):
#   core PKG           the trust layer, held to a budget
#   in   PKG [FILE…]   audited; with files, those alone and the rest outside
#   out  PKG REASON    outside, and why
# In is what decides who may do what, holds or derives a key, parses input
# from outside the membership, or runs as root. make tcb fails on a package
# placed nowhere and on a listed package or file that is gone.

core types
core trust/enroll
core trust/log
core trust/secrets
core trust/store

in gossip
in internal/aead
in internal/atomicfile
in internal/addrkey
in internal/dnsfwd
in internal/ingress
in internal/keyring
in internal/keys
in internal/names
